---
import ProofStrip from '../ui/ProofStrip.astro';
import ShopMock from '../b2c/ShopMock.astro';
---
<section id="top" class="section aud-hero"><div class="container"><div><div><div class="aud-switch"><p class="aud-ask">I sell to …</p><div role="group" aria-label="Choose who you sell to" class="aud-pills"><a data-aud-set="b2b" aria-pressed="true" role="button" href="/?for=b2b" class="aud-pill">Businesses</a><a data-aud-set="b2c" aria-pressed="false" role="button" href="/?for=b2c" class="aud-pill">Consumers</a></div><p class="aud-hint">Tell us how you sell - this page adapts to you.</p></div><h1 data-aud-show="b2b" class="heading-h1">Trade orders straight into your ERP <span class="hero_highlight">from a portal, an email or your webshop</span></h1><p role="heading" aria-level="1" data-aud-show="b2c" class="heading-h1">Stop using your current consumer shop. <span class="hero_highlight">Switch to one built on your ERP.</span></p><p data-aud-show="b2b" class="text-lead">Your team stops retyping emailed orders and taking the same reorders by phone. We build the portal, read the emails, fix the webshop link, and keep it all running for a fixed price.</p><p data-aud-show="b2c" class="text-lead">Every order reaches your ERP. The price at checkout is the price in your ERP. We build the shop, move everything across, and run it.</p><div data-aud-show="b2b" class="aud-ctas"><a href="#order-check" class="button is-large">Book a free consultation</a><a href="#v2-how" class="button is-secondary is-large">See how it works</a></div><div data-aud-show="b2c" class="aud-ctas"><a href="#order-check" class="button is-large">Book a free consultation</a><a href="/solutions/b2c" class="button is-secondary is-large">See how it works</a></div><p data-aud-show="b2b" class="aud-note">&#xA3;5,000 to set up. &#xA3;300 a month. For manufacturers, distributors and wholesalers, whichever ERP you run.</p><p data-aud-show="b2c" class="aud-note">Fixed price, agreed after the free consultation. Whichever ERP you run.</p><div data-aud-show="b2b"><ProofStrip /></div></div><div><div data-aud-show="b2b" class="ord-card"><div class="ord-card_top"><div><div class="ord-card_label">B2B portal · signed in as buyer</div><div class="ord-card_cust">Your customer&#x27;s own catalogue</div><div class="ord-card_meta">Their prices · their assortment · their approvals</div></div><div class="ord-badge">Live from your ERP</div></div><div><div class="ord-item">Hex bolt M8 × 40, stainless steel A2</div><div class="ord-qty">240 pcs in stock</div><div class="ord-codes">SKU 100-4711</div><div class="ord-ok">✓ Customer price</div></div><div><div class="ord-item">Hex bolt M8 × 60, stainless steel A2</div><div class="ord-qty">85 pcs in stock</div><div class="ord-codes">SKU 100-4712</div><div class="ord-ok">✓ Tiered price</div></div><div><div class="ord-item">Nut M8, stainless steel A2</div><div class="ord-qty">1,200 pcs in stock</div><div class="ord-codes">SKU 100-5020</div><div class="ord-ok">✓ Reorder from history</div></div><div><div class="ord-item">Digital quote</div><div class="ord-qty"> </div><div class="ord-codes">Order and pay with one click</div><div class="ord-ok">✓ Approved by buyer</div></div><div class="ord-foot"><div>Order sent straight to your ERP</div><div>No retyping</div></div><p class="ord-caption">Illustrative example.</p></div><div data-aud-show="b2c"><ShopMock /></div></div></div></div></section>